# Episode tracker

Do **not** attach an Episode tracker section to ordinary responses. The user asked to stop that.

Run `node scripts/episode-tracker.mjs` (and `--canvas` after story.json or audit edits) only when the user asks for the tracker, the canvas, or episode grades/word counts.

Grades live in `scripts/.cache/audit/episode-audit.md`. Word counts are live from `src/lib/data/story.json`. When an episode is rewritten and re-graded, update its `**Grade:**` line in that file so the tracker stays true.
